// Light Energy = Direct Scattering + Ambient Scattering + Secondary Scattering
// Direct Scattering represents all of the light energy coming from the sun.
// Ambient scattering represents the light energy coming from the sky and neighboring clouds.
// Secondary scattering represents the light energy from sources like Lightning.

